{"availability":"available","full":"daltlc/zephyr-framework","name":"zephyr-framework","description":"Zero-JS interactive UI framework using Web Components, CSS :has(), View Transitions API, and container queries","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-24T02:25:29Z","updated":"2026-08-15T23:48:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://zephyr-agent-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:49:53.400Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:49:53.400Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:49:53.400Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.696Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:44:53.094Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:13:05.235Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:31:03.868Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:49:53.400Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["14 core components + dashboard add-on. Pure CSS interactions. Zero runtime JavaScript.","MCP server lets Claude Desktop, Cursor, and any AI agent control your UI with typed tools.","A2UI catalog makes your components discoverable across Google's agent ecosystem."],"features":["Screenshot parsing (computer use) — Slow, brittle, expensive. A CSS change breaks everything. Costs thousands of tokens per interaction.","Raw HTML analysis — The agent parses DOM structure, guesses what elements do, and writes JavaScript to manipulate them. Error-prone, high token cost, fragile.","State lives in data- attributes — not hidden in JS closures or framework internals. An agent can read data-open on any component and instantly know its state.","Zero runtime JS — No framework code runs during interactions, which means no race conditions, no async state to track, no timing issues for agents.","Minimal API surface — The entire agent interface fits in a few hundred tokens. Low context window cost means agents can hold the full Zephyr API in memory while doing other work."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daltlc/zephyr-framework/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"87e7c00fe232345c49c4d2c4af66f756962a528a65989569ef0e0fdf5562cf79","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:18.498Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T04:30:47.574Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"14 core components + dashboard add-on. Pure CSS interactions. Zero runtime JavaScript.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daltlc/zephyr-framework/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"zephyr-agent.sh is a static, client-side snippet generator — no account, no storage, nothing sent to its servers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daltlc/zephyr-framework/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"87e7c00fe232345c49c4d2c4af66f756962a528a65989569ef0e0fdf5562cf79","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daltlc/zephyr-framework/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:30:47.575Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-15T23:48:14Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:15.459Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/daltlc/zephyr-framework/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T04:30:47.576Z","hash":"87e7c00fe232345c49c4d2c4af66f756962a528a65989569ef0e0fdf5562cf79","originalBytes":38480,"storedBytes":38480,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:53.012Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:53.012Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/d8e26147f60e2541ca75e863.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-12T13:53:02.773Z","url":"https://zephyr-agent-demo.vercel.app/"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T13:53:02.773Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://zephyr-agent-demo.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-12T13:53:02.773Z","status":"working","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-19T13:53:02.773Z","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T13:53:02.773Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-12T13:53:02.773Z","target